11) The big “gotchas” you should decide NOW (or Codex will guess wrong)
These are not defined in the PDF, but must be defined for code:
1. Exact bias rule: how many impulse candles define it? last 2? last 3?
2. What is “momentum”: ATR-based? body/range ratio?
3. Which wick levels count: highs vs lows (I recommend lows for bullish, highs for bearish)
4. How to compute the impulse leg for 50%: last swing-to-swing? last N bars?
5. Structure break “significant”: fractal pivots? zigzag threshold?
6. Entry type: market on close vs limit at 50% (PDF implies a zone + confirmation; market-after-close is simplest and matches “No candle close = no entry.” )
