12) If you want my “codeable default settings” (so this actually works)
If you don’t specify, here’s what I’d ship as defaults:
Bias:
last 2 H4 candles must be impulse candles in same direction
Momentum candle:
body >= 0.6 range AND range >= 1.0 ATR(14)
Consolidation filter:
ATR(14) < ATR_Min OR (HighestHigh(20)-LowestLow(20)) < RangeMin
Untouched wick:
use wick lows for bull, wick highs for bear
Sweep:
breach level by 2–5 pips (or symbol points) then close back beyond
Displacement breakout:
body >= 1.2 ATR(14) on M5, close beyond structure by buffer
CHoCH:
close breaks last pivot in opposite direction (fractals lookback 2)

